    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the clockwork chambers of <i>Geargrid</i>, where every match you make turns the cogs of a grand steampunk engine. This tile-matching puzzle adventure fuses vintage machinery aesthetics with addictive gameplay. Sort, stack, and solve intricate puzzles across handcrafted mechanical stages\u2014each one more challenging than the last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd29 <strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Match 3 identical tiles to clear the grid and keep the gears turning</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stunning steampunk visuals with brass, copper, and gear-laced detail</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increasing difficulty and layered puzzle design for true tacticians</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fluid animations and polished UI in a vintage industrial theme</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Casual yet deeply satisfying gameplay loop</p></li></ul>",
